REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0013

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

Running pace handoff must be automatic in any AI chat -- the user must
never have to trigger it by hand.

RAW_TEXT

Correr pace handoff es cosa normal del proceso automatico en cualquier
chat? correcto es decir el usuario no tiene que hacerlo por cuenta propia?

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

AI coding clients (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot and others) automatically
read an AGENTS.md file at the repository root when a session starts. PACE
now writes that file (only if absent -- never clobbering the owner's own
AGENTS.md) instructing every AI to run pace handoff first and obey it.
The onboarding becomes zero-touch for the user: opening the project in
any AI tool loads PACE's memory without anyone asking for it.

PROMOTED_TO

F6-32 (AGENTS.md auto-onboarding pointer, written by the handoff engine)

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
